{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:34 2026-07-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:34 2026-07-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:34 2026-07-14 HKT</p><p>將軍澳有工人墮坑。今日（14日）下午1時25分，一名男工人在影業路與集福路交界一工地內，跌落2米深坑。他清醒但未能脫困，由工友協助報案。救援人員到場，將傷者救起送往伊利沙伯醫院救治，其間一名工友陪同傷者送院。警方正調查事故原因。</p><img alt=\"事發的工地。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c9ea20085150ab48aede29d8c4010f73/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_31_10_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/804b0e3e0ca041994e45edd5da6d39c7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_31_10.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5e4c55f083f38e04b5a48b542f74a6c3/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_31_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工人墮2米深坑受傷，送院時清醒。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8aa2dd182ed5688ddc2a9b47e872fd1d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_17_00.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f94d59a6e7fe0a1e616bd499cae67ad7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_17_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"受傷工人由救護車送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9d7e7270b4b56054d1b77f8b1013ad73/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_17_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工友陪同傷者送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/41bf4c5dd06f3f262ae448b49fa795a7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_22_09.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e33cf876d36dc29b15905d458c018197/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_22_08.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9830928035cbf4c677394be5d4e33380/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_22_09_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9d4eee62fb34b65629d3568663d82a75/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-14_at_14_22_11.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T06:58:35.835389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}